   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Zhian,<div><br></div><div>When I use plot_poppr_msn() function to plot minimum spanning tree, I get below graph:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/poppr/attach/152cc15875ba08/klip1.PNG?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"klip1.PNG\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>But it seems that there is overlap on population names, how can I get more space for population names or which parameter I need to use to get a more clear legend?  Also how to remove the notification on each node to the side of node? because some notifications are not clear when they show just on the above of the node? I have seen the different parameters on the function plot_poppr_msn(), but do not understand which one is correct? </div><div><br></div><div>So may I ask for your help?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot.</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>Ying</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "vN0n_GY5FQAJ",
   "from": "Nikolaos Tourvas",
   "author": "c9df9e12efe33730",
   "date": "2020-02-14T14:24:14Z",
   "subject": "Re: How to get more space or avoid overlap on legend when using plot_poppr_msn()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear Ying,</div><div><br></div><div>Regarding moving the labels to \r\nthe side, you can use the option &quot;vertex.label.dist = 1&quot; (try different \r\nnumbers to see what looks best for you) within the plot_poppr_msn()\r\nfunction. <br></div><div><br></div><div>As for the legend, I am not sure of how to fix via the plot_poppr_msn() function, but you could try hiding the legend completely (by setting &quot;pop.leg = FALSE&quot;) and adding a new legend using base graphics. I attach an example below.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">poppr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf_dist</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pinf_filtered </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> filter_stats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> distance </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf_dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mlg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> distance </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diss</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> algorithm </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;n&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf_msn</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> poppr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> distmat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf_dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> showplot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>plot_poppr_msn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf_msn</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mlg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               gadj </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               nodescale </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               cutoff </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               quantiles </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               beforecut </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               pop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># hide pop legend</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               scale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               vertex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dist </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># move labels to the side</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               palette </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colors</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;topleft&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">levels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pinf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colors</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><br>Hope it helps.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Τη Παρασκευή, 14 Φεβρουαρίου 2020 - 12:32:28 μ.μ. UTC+2, ο χρήστης Ying Wang έγραψε:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Zhian,<div><br></div><div>When I use plot_poppr_msn() function to plot minimum spanning tree, I get below graph:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/poppr/attach/152cc15875ba08/klip1.PNG?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"klip1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>But it seems that there is overlap on population names, how can I get more space for population names or which parameter I need to use to get a more clear legend?  Also how to remove the notification on each node to the side of node? because some notifications are not clear when they show just on the above of the node? I have seen the different parameters on the function plot_poppr_msn(), but do not understand which one is correct? </div><div><br></div><div>So may I ask for your help?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot.</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards</div><div>Ying</div></div></blockquote></div>"
